    <briefdescription>
<para>Stateless bridge between the two JSON libraries and response bodies. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The codebase uses JsonCpp for HTTP responses (Drogon) and jsoncons for validation. This utility wraps simple message objects and serialises either representation to a pretty-printed string. All members are static and construction is deleted: there is no state and no thread-safety concern beyond the underlying libraries. <simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classValidator" kindref="compound">Validator</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
